    "dgf_testimonial_f9eLmm": {
      "type": "dgf-testimonial",
      "blocks": {
        "testimonial_HYVqM7": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "<i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>",
            "testimonial_text": "<p>I’ve been taking this product for years it’s good for so many different health issues.</p>",
            "author_name": "-Connie Basore"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_9TFRER": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "<i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>",
            "testimonial_text": "<p>Tribe Organics doesn't cut corners on their supplements, and their organic moringa is no exception. I noticed a gradual positive improvement after several weeks of taking this supplement. Sharper thinking, better sleep, more energy, were all detectable, so I am extremely pleased with this addition to my diet, and will definitely continue to take. Top rating for Tribe Organics Moringa,and well deserved.</p>",
            "author_name": "-Ted"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_hY9qxr": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "<i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>",
            "testimonial_text": "<p>Great quality and value. Gives me a little morning boost. Responsive CS. Fabulous company!!<br/><br/></p>",
            "author_name": "-Susan Andrews"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_UPPjqQ": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "<i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>",
            "testimonial_text": "<p>I’ve been taking three capsules each morning for the past month and wow—my focus is sharper, my digestion feels lighter, and the usual afternoon slump is gone. Total game-changer!</p>",
            "author_name": "- Amanda Lewis"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_KFf9gk": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "<i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>",
            "testimonial_text": "<p>I started using these capsules to support my immune system and gut health, but what surprised me most is how calm and collected I feel day-to-day. I take them every morning and actually look forward to how they make me feel.</p>",
            "author_name": "- Ben Walker"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_kPpBWj": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "<i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>",
            "testimonial_text": "<p>Three capsules a day, and my digestion is the best it’s ever been. I don’t feel heavy or gassy after meals anymore, and my mood feels more even. Such a clean, effective product!</p>",
            "author_name": "- Sofia Herrera"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_UDbEcr": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "<i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>",
            "testimonial_text": "<p>I’ve taken a lot of mushroom supplements, but this one is the real deal. It supports my immune system, clears my mind, and even helps me sleep better.</p>",
            "author_name": "- Sam P."
          }
        },
        "testimonial_jjaTQJ": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "<i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>",
            "testimonial_text": "<p>My stress levels are noticeably lower, and my focus is dialed in. This blend has become my go-to for staying grounded during busy weeks.</p>",
            "author_name": "- Eric S."
          }
        },
        "testimonial_XxBHFM": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "<i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>",
            "testimonial_text": "<p>After a month on these, I feel more stable emotionally, and my sleep is more restful. It’s subtle, but powerful.</p>",
            "author_name": "- Rebecca J."
          }
        },
        "testimonial_HCkRF9": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "<i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>",
            "testimonial_text": "<p>I used to rely on caffeine in the afternoons. Now I don’t need it—this gives me clean, sustained energy without the crash.</p>",
            "author_name": "- Ivan M."
          }
        },
        "testimonial_DBGBUT": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "<i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>\n                                                <i class=\"fa fa-star active\"></i>",
            "testimonial_text": "<p>Love that it’s just mushrooms—no caffeine, no sketchy extras. Just pure support for my focus and immune system.</p>",
            "author_name": "- Brent Z."
          }
        }
      },
